// VibeStudio sample map: a sealed Quake-family room.
//
// Hand-authored for VibeStudio. No geometry, texture, or entity data is taken
// from a commercial game; the texture names are generic placeholders, so this
// is a parser and geometry fixture rather than a compilable level for any
// particular game.
//
// Six box brushes seal a room around the origin and a seventh has a diagonal
// clip plane whose three defining points lie outside the finished solid, which
// is exactly the case a bounding box of the plane points gets wrong and a real
// half-space solve gets right.
{
"classname" "worldspawn"
"message" "VibeStudio Sample Room"
"wad" "textures/sample.wad"
